,"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thc202/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thc202/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2019-04-04T19:16:20Z","updated_at":"2023-04-14T18:05:52Z","closed_at":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Zap should prevent outbound proxy from being configured with the same details as a local proxy (ex: Zap shouldn't talk to itself).\r\n\r\nFrom: https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/zaproxy-users/OuGcKmxMO0I\r\n\r\n> Thanks for the tip on using wireshark. That let me to two interesting observations:\r\n> 1. for some reason I was seeing the same HTTP request repeated numerous times in the capture\r\n> 2. I didn't see any packets leave Zap en route to the destination\r\n> \r\n> This led me to poke around the Zap config where I realized I had \"Use an outgoing proxy server\" selected. And what was the proxy server configured to use? localhost:8080, the same as Zap was listening for inbound proxy requests. Once I deselected that option everything started working again.\r\n> \r\n> Obviously this was a config error on my part but I suspect the debugging was more difficult because Zap was able to be configured to use the same proxy address for inbound (under \"local proxies\" section) and outbound connections (under \"connection\" section). It might be worth disallowing this configuration since I can't imagine that ever working correctly. As a test I changed the outbound proxy to use 127.0.0.1:8081 and I immediately saw a more helpful \"connection refused\" error.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zaproxy/zaproxy/issues/5308/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zaproxy/zaproxy/issues/5308/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}